Windows Rust authorized worklist and bounded MP4 download

Usage: doustudio.exe <COMMAND>

Commands:
  credential-check  Entirely local Cookie structure diagnostic. No signing, DNS, or HTTP
  acceptance        Interactive, separately authorized acceptance with a single in-memory selection
  list
  download
  verify
  help              Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
